(Solen Energy sponsors coastal clean-up) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
([P1] Solen Energy has agreed to fund a year of monthly beach clean-ups along the) Tj
T*
(northern coast. The company will pay for gloves, bags and a small truck, while) Tj
T*
(local volunteers will organise the work itself.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
([P2] The first clean-up is planned for the last weekend of the month. Volunteers) Tj
T*
(will meet at a car park near the dunes and work in small groups, with a hot) Tj
T*
(drink provided at the end of the morning.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
([P3] A company spokesperson said the sponsorship is part of a wider community) Tj
T*
(programme and does not change the firm's normal operations. Local organisers) Tj
T*
(said they hope to collect data on the most common types of litter.) Tj
T*
() Tj
